### HTML API DOCUMENTATION: This can be a different page
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000


### API ENDPOINTS
### Create a document
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/pets
Content-type: application/json



### Retrieve a document
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/pets
Content-type: application/json

### Adds a new pet to the document
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/pets/reset
Content-type: application/json

 {
    "name": "red",
    "type": "cat",
    "breed": "no clue",
    "sex": "Female",
    "color": "grey",
    "spayed": "Yes",
    "age": 1,
    "description": "She is actually the meanest cat I've ever owned"
  }

### clears a file and inserts a new pet
  PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/pets/reset
  Content-type: application/json


### Delete the content of the document
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/pets
Content-type: application/json

